      {
        "id": 57457,
        "name": "Sarpathian",
        "username": "Sarpathian",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/sarpathian/{size}/2148_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-04T12:37:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I had a crazy random last night. &nbsp;TL Tachyon, Bunker EoW, Legacy and The Scholar vs Omni in Time Portal. &nbsp;It was a complete one sided fight until the computer room pulled the Electro-Pulse Explosive right before the villain turn so it went off before any damage could be done to it.... 15 per hero across the board knocked everyone near single digits. &nbsp;No deaths of heroes and Scholar was almost full again at the end. &nbsp;Just a rout. &nbsp;Pretty overpowered team though I imagine any team with TLT and Legacy would be.</p>",
