        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-30T19:59:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The ultimate team:</p><p>Legacy, Team Leader Tachyon, Dark Visionary, and Omnitron-X. I can't think of a situation they can't handle, and they are all great by themselves,&nbsp;and the combos are amazing. Lead From the Front almost guarantees no components are destroyed is just one of the many&nbsp;broken combos I can think of.</p>",
